WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.251
This briefing comes from
Book 03 of the Federal

2
00:00:03.251 --> 00:00:06.287
Modernization Workbook,
HR-Driven Identity.

3
00:00:06.287 --> 00:00:09.930
It has one proposal, and I'll
take it through four questions,

4
00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:13.877
the way I'd take it to leadership:
why it matters, what we should do,

5
00:00:13.877 --> 00:00:17.975
who has to be involved, and how we'd
carry it out and know it's working.

6
00:00:17.975 --> 00:00:23.287
Book 02 made the case that identity is
now where every access decision is made.

7
00:00:23.287 --> 00:00:27.025
This book asks where the facts behind
that identity should come from.

8
00:00:27.025 --> 00:00:30.460
The answer is the HR system
of record, starting now.
